      "title": "Note: Headless Agent example",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "This is the *headless* Agent path: an official Comfy-MCP-speaking Agent discovers `MajoorOmniCamDirector` and `MajoorOmniCamMonitor` through the normal ComfyUI `/object_info` schema and drives them like any other node -- it edits `state_json` / the widgets directly and queues this graph.\n\nThis is deliberately the *simplest* runnable pair (Director -> Monitor, profile `wan_camera_native`). See `examples/agent/README.md` for how this differs from the *live* Agent path (the OmniCam Agent Contract v1), which instead reaches a Director instance already open in a browser through `docs/AGENT_INTEGRATION.md`.\n\nNothing here is Agent-specific at the graph level: this workflow runs exactly like any other OmniCam Director -> Monitor pair once queued."
      ]
    },
